{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Before I can recommend a stack, I need the one thing an empty repo can't tell me: what are we building? In a sentence or two, plain language — what should this project do, and who's it for?","recommended":"I can't recommend a stack until I know the product — so my recommendation here is simply: tell me the core idea in your own words (e.g. \"a web app for tracking X\", \"a CLI that does Y\"), and I'll take it from there."},"prd":"# Mission: (foundation — pending capture)\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Stand up the project foundation — a running skeleton, a working test system, and one thin vertical slice proving they are connected.\n\n_(PRD in progress — awaiting the captain's description of what we're building before a stack can be recommended.)_"}

